#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To get information about a qubit's state, you can _measure_ it onto a [classical bit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit). In Qiskit, measurements are performed in the computational basis, that is, the single-qubit Pauli-$Z$ basis. Therefore, a measurement yields 0 or 1, depending on the overlap with the Pauli-$Z$ eigenstates $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$:\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"للحصول على معلومات حول حالة الكيوبت، يمكنك _قياسه_ على [بت كلاسيكي](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit). في Qiskit، تُجرى القياسات في الأساس الحسابي، أي أساس Pauli-$Z$ أحادي الكيوبت. لذلك، يُعطي القياس القيمة 0 أو 1، تبعاً للتداخل مع الحالات الذاتية لـ Pauli-$Z$ وهي $|0\\rangle$ و$|1\\rangle$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a measurement to a circuit {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"
msgstr "تطبيق قياس على دائرة {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to apply measurements to a circuit:\n"
msgstr "هناك عدة طرق لتطبيق القياسات على دائرة:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"
msgstr "طريقة `QuantumCircuit.measure` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure) method to measure a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-class).\n"
msgstr "استخدم طريقة [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure) لقياس [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-class).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples:\n"
msgstr "أمثلة:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Measure` class {#measure-class}"
msgstr "صنف `Measure` {#measure-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit [Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure) class measures the specified qubits.\n"
msgstr "يقوم صنف Qiskit [Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure) بقياس الكيوبتات المحددة.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure_all` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"
msgstr "طريقة `QuantumCircuit.measure_all` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To measure all qubits into the corresponding classical bits, use the [`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all) method. By default, this method adds new classical bits in a `ClassicalRegister` to store these measurements.\n"
msgstr "لقياس جميع الكيوبتات في البتات الكلاسيكية المقابلة لها، استخدم طريقة [`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all). بشكل افتراضي، تضيف هذه الطريقة بتات كلاسيكية جديدة في `ClassicalRegister` لتخزين هذه القياسات.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure_active` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-method}"
msgstr "طريقة `QuantumCircuit.measure_active` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To measure all qubits that are not idle, use the [`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active) method. This method creates a new `ClassicalRegister` with a size equal to the number of non-idle qubits being measured.\n"
msgstr "لقياس جميع الكيوبتات غير الخاملة، استخدم طريقة [`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active). تنشئ هذه الطريقة `ClassicalRegister` جديداً بحجم يساوي عدد الكيوبتات غير الخاملة المُراد قياسها.\n"

